+# Inventory service API
+
+Service class: `com.lego.inventory.InventoryService`. Errors are `ApiException` with an HTTP status.
+
+## addProduct(sku, name, available)
+- 200: the product
+- 400: blank sku or name, negative available
+- 409: sku already exists
+
+## get(sku)
+- 200: `{sku, name, available}`
+- 400: blank sku
+- 404: unknown sku
+
+## addStock(sku, quantity)
+- 200: the updated product
+- 400: quantity is not positive
+- 404: unknown sku
+
+## reserve(sku, quantity)
+- 200: the updated product with available stock reduced by quantity
+- 400: blank sku or non-positive quantity
+- 404: unknown sku
+- 409: insufficient stock
+
+## release(sku, quantity)
+- 200: the updated product with available stock increased by quantity
+- 400: blank sku or non-positive quantity
+- 404: unknown sku
+
+## list()
+All products in insertion order.
